<title>FRANCE: Morocco seeks 50,000 tonnes optional wheat - trade.</title>
<headline>Morocco seeks 50,000 tonnes optional wheat - trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco will tender on December 16 to import 50,000 tonnes of optional-origin soft wheat, European grain traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for delivery between January 1 and January 10, they said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
